      "title": "One ECS for the demo",
      "items": [
        "web and worker share one image; only the start command differs",
        "ocr runs only with the compose profile, capped at 1.5 CPU / 1.5 GB",
        "Images from Docker Hub (quix07) or SWR; raw files stay on the ECS volume for now",
